Hidalgo is a 2004 epic biographical Western film directed
by Joe Johnston and written by John Fusco.

11
01:33:30,000 --> 01:33:36,000
Based on the legend of the American distance rider Frank Hopkins and his mustang Hidalgo, it recounts
Hopkins' racing his horse in Arabia in 1891 against Bedouins riding pure-blooded Arabian horses.

12
01:42:00,000 --> 01:42:06,000
The film stars Viggo Mortensen, Zuleikha Robinson, and Omar Sharif.

13
